## Medical Disclaimer

This software is designed for educational and research purposes as part of a 
hackathon submission. It is NOT intended for actual clinical use and should 
NOT be used to make real medical decisions.

ALL OUTPUT FROM THIS SYSTEM MUST BE REVIEWED BY QUALIFIED HEALTHCARE 
PROFESSIONALS before any clinical application.

The creators of this software are not responsible for any medical decisions 
made based on the output of this system. Always consult with qualified 
healthcare providers for medical advice and treatment decisions.

